  startText: "- \u0110\u1EBFn nh\xE0 c\u1EE7a tr\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0ng"
  action1Text: "- Quan s\xE1t xung quanh v\xE0 t\xECm l\u1ED1i tho\xE1t"
  action2Text: "- Gi\u1EA3i m\xE3 t\u01B0\u1EE3ng n\u1EEF th\u1EA7n"
  action3Text: "- T\xECm ch\xECa kh\xF3a \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa h\u1EA7m ng\u1EE5c"
  action4Text: "- Thu th\u1EADp m\u1EA3nh kim c\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF
    kh\xF3a h\u1EA7m ng\u1EE5c"
  action5Text: "- \u0110\xE1nh b\u1EA1i Cthulu"
  action6Text: "- Di chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1EBFn v\xF9ng n\xFAi ph\xEDa b\u1EAFc..."
  action7Text: 
  action8Text: 
  action9Text: 
  action10Text: 
  completedText: "Kh\xF4ng c\xF2n nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 n\xE0o."
